Sample applications needed for portfolio:
1. ftrace/OpenDTrace scripting on some target app demonstrating location of
	kernel hot spot(s) or bug(s)
2. eBPF
3. Simple Rust sample app:
	A. You make regular trips to your bank once a week on Saturdays
		starting 1/3/26.
	B. You refill your hummingbird feeder once a month, always on the 25th.
		Write a program to determine on which dates you will do BOTH tasks
		over the 5 years from Jan 2026 through Dec 2030.
4. DPDK EAL
5. OpenBMC
6. DO-178C
7. Expand/extend current Jetson Nano ML project to include several different
	bottles, plus a spreadsheet of no. of photographs taken to train and %
	accuracy identifying them.
8. Build an AI robot that responds to spoken commands and performs simple
	tasks (fetch a pencil, check a webcam to see who's at the door, go recharge
	itself etc.).  Stretch goal:  robot will respond to commands at highest
	priority, but will fill in its own time once that is done.  So build the
	robot a small "pet" robot that it will feed, walk etc. whenever it isn't
	doing something for humans.

